      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPresenting No. 113 Exchange Hall.\n\nThis one bedroom apartment comes to the market in good condition throughout, boasting a very spacious living area and fully fitted kitchen aswell as being freshly painted.\n\nThe development benefits from its close proximity to all amenities from resturants and pubs to shops and buses - the list is endless, this particular apartment has no onward chain so perfect for all types of buyers.\n\nAlso within short walking distance is LUAS, Tallaght Stadium, Sean Walsh Memorial Park and Tallaght Hospital. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises living/dining area, kitchen, one double bedroom and family bathroom. \n\nCall or email for viewing details."
